{"id":"47cb59806fd7ea7e","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-grz-frame-completeness.md","title":"Finite Partial-Order Completeness for Grz","display":"thm-grz-frame-completeness — Finite Partial-Order Completeness for Grz","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-grz-frame-completeness","aliases":["89-thm-grz-frame-completeness"],"display":"thm-grz-frame-completeness — Finite Partial-Order Completeness for Grz","depends_on":["[[89-df-grz-frame]]","[[89-df-grz-logic]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]","[[89-df-dotted-translation]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-grz-frame-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-grz-frame-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-grz-frame-completeness — Finite Partial-Order Completeness for Grz"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"38350e32be23e7a3\" href=\"?note=38350e32be23e7a3\" title=\"89-df-grz-frame\">89-df-grz-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e67bc8e485daa168\" href=\"?note=e67bc8e485daa168\" title=\"89-df-grz-logic\">89-df-grz-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3fc95f0f8defc51d\" href=\"?note=3fc95f0f8defc51d\" title=\"89-df-dotted-translation\">89-df-dotted-translation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Grz}\">\\(\\mathrm{Grz}\\)</span> 为 Grzegorczyk 定理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GrzFin}\">\\(\\mathrm{GrzFin}\\)</span> 为有限偏序框架谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>框架量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall F\">\\(\\forall F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall F=(W,R)\">\\(\\forall F=(W,R)\\)</span> 的域为所有集合对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(W,R)\">\\((W,R)\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)\\)</span>；不对任意非框架集合调用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\models A\">\\(F\\models A\\)</span> 或框架性质谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}grz\\text{-}frame\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{Grz}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\ (\\mathrm{GrzFin}(F)\\to F\\models A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}grz\\text{-}frame\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{Grz}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\ (\\mathrm{GrzFin}(F)\\to F\\models A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 12 章，印刷页 155–164；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n原书的 Grz 完全性定理。有限 GL 框架加对角线后形成有限偏序；递归 dotted 翻译对应两种关系下的盒。有限偏序删去对角线形成有限 GL 框架。将真值对应与 GL 完全性、Grz 的翻译定理结合得到此式。原书也讨论逆弱良基的无限反射框架；本原子只断言明确的有限版本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-grz-frame","status":"resolved","id":"38350e32be23e7a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-grz-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-grz-logic","status":"resolved","id":"e67bc8e485daa168","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-grz-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-dotted-translation","status":"resolved","id":"3fc95f0f8defc51d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-dotted-translation]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Grz}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GrzFin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall F","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KFrame}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"F\\models A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}grz\\text{-}frame\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\nA\\in\\mathrm{Grz}\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall F\\ (\\mathrm{GrzFin}(F)\\to F\\models A).","display":true}],"bytes":1493,"backlinks":[{"id":"e67bc8e485daa168","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"Grz 相对于有限自反、传递、反对称框架完全，见 [[89-thm-grz-frame-completeness]]。"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-grz-logic]] → [[89-df-dotted-translation]] → [[89-df-grz-frame]] → [[89-thm-grz-frame-completeness]] → [[89-thm-grz-translation]]"}],"outgoing":["38350e32be23e7a3","e67bc8e485daa168","dbba58e7bd3b0667","3fc95f0f8defc51d"]}